        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Scaffolding learning activities with collaborative scripts and mobile devices</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-3">My dissertation examined how mobile devices, collaborative scripts and pedagogical scaffolding can support learning in real-life contexts.</p>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">The core argument remains practical: technology supports learning only when the task, interaction and guidance have been carefully designed.</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
