<section class="py-5 border-bottom" id="lectio">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <p class="text-uppercase fw-bold small text-primary mb-1">Lectio precursoria</p>
      <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-2">Opening lecture from the defence</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-0">The lectio summarises the starting point of the research in Finnish: mobile devices do not change learning by themselves. They need pedagogical purpose, scaffolding and a structure for collaborative work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 rounded-4 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/TIi1tTZqHvU?list=PLDG0jxUrk8z2oNCSbotS_yNVjtnEALFP0"
